    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-251800d3-c972-4d2c-9554-ac4e67f869ab" n="1982" facs="#m-b428e949-52d1-40c1-8a9e-dcf53223f336" /><div xml:id="m-797e574a-1027-4a5e-a1c7-c2945ac38e35">
            <lg xml:id="m-39297dc0-cbf2-4fef-be38-55659fcb2376">
              <l xml:id="m-0686797d-3814-4369-8f3f-36dcade55e50" facs="#m-33095b93-6486-4889-b28a-df2f56e33cd7" label="ambiguous">1736</l><l xml:id="m-ac8fc86d-5853-4559-b3d6-88d5e4127a6b" facs="#m-05d170e7-19f9-4d7d-9156-cef027a635c6" label="ambiguous">November 2.</l><l xml:id="m-95d890e3-37b4-4999-b8f7-f0092a88163f" facs="#m-fc17cc8a-7a70-475d-a333-80a91fb629bc" label="lyrics-like">Réquiem actérnam* dóna éis,</l><l xml:id="m-b93eb84c-0f42-4ec8-91a8-2eeb529dae49" facs="#m-e17f9014-841d-4400-a691-534a1c2f4360" label="lyrics-like">In me transiérunt frae túae:*</l><l xml:id="m-71c1cfa9-63fa-4651-949e-2cca58d44c8b" facs="#m-665ae99a-d7c9-4ac6-86ed-b3c3027b112a" label="lyrics-like">Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-0f709493-0302-4d2a-9a11-74d760324e8c" facs="#m-74c36f26-d6ce-4286-8313-e26c69375e17" label="lyrics-like">et terróres túi conturbavérunt me.</l><l xml:id="m-50c6811b-433a-47aa-9af9-a2c24450d389" facs="#m-2f04093c-69af-4927-96a2-7524c1850cfe" label="lyrics-like">Circumdedérunt me sicut áqua</l><l xml:id="m-b9d48696-f203-4c34-a78f-e628ed9cb00a" facs="#m-d993a388-37ca-46c6-aef1-bafc16e1f296" label="lyrics-like">Et lux perpétua “ lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-8394c5f7-fb46-48d4-9a04-d62f120c0976" facs="#m-efb6b76a-584e-4316-a8ea-d1daee93d491" label="lyrics-like">tóta diecircumdedérunt me</l><l xml:id="m-810e75b2-bc89-484a-8f6b-f60a4530f072" facs="#m-c30f90f5-58de-4e0e-9884-bd1bbc81b0ae" label="ambiguous">simul.</l><l xml:id="m-5af10384-6f7c-496e-8b96-7b43e6c35d46" facs="#m-2c989fea-1c44-48a0-838c-c78117beb6d9" label="ambiguous">Psalm 31.</l><l xml:id="m-337de69f-473e-4028-b5f5-6bd3bbb78ce2" facs="#m-8e910bb6-8939-46da-9542-926ef2390faa" label="lyrics-like">Elongásti a me amícum et pró¬</l><l xml:id="m-60b8ebd4-7383-4f50-8a66-a1b59dfb1a51" facs="#m-28d34c0f-c900-4818-a5ab-8f09874dcf2c" label="lyrics-like">ximum :* et nótos méos a miséria.</l><l xml:id="m-9f81dc09-6c7f-44a2-9c56-ebeb2a5f6d36" facs="#m-d1ef3846-2d33-451f-86ce-999215f150d8" label="lyrics-like">2 Eáti quórum remissae sunt ini¬</l><l xml:id="m-b548fb38-b4ed-4d0b-8c5a-287c7a47610d" facs="#m-d6cd0f09-2da8-4b22-8ef2-7b03f5f9c690" label="lyrics-like">Réquiem aetérnam* dóna éts,</l><l xml:id="m-3aa56606-2243-4e83-8411-28ef668371b8" facs="#m-7302c260-7006-47a2-9505-ebd7756da219" label="lyrics-like">D quitátes: * et quórum técta</l><l xml:id="m-8c0db04e-0aa8-40d0-9528-11be39f2e02f" facs="#m-1d9082d8-529e-43a7-b703-b836f3f2231e" label="lyrics-like">Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-25997094-d293-42d1-b513-0ee43f719e5e" facs="#m-922a7757-a9ae-4eb4-a29b-144c20ef925b" label="lyrics-like">sunt peceâta.</l><l xml:id="m-b2075891-71ca-4785-905b-25ec5a276eb9" facs="#m-f5a296c2-1602-4618-b6cc-1dfc113c33bf" label="lyrics-like">Et lux perpétua * lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-d4b9c552-e9d0-4b83-bcb4-33ebc2bb7648" facs="#m-de6863c1-03ed-46a3-9645-31fee96f6309" label="lyrics-like">Beátus vir cúi non imputávit Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-93646164-43a9-4260-b9d6-e8666826c501" facs="#m-a07c8c00-3a88-44d6-8a60-362c46c54ed3" label="lyrics-like">minus peceátum, * nec est in spí¬</l><l xml:id="m-a6124fbb-33ea-4afc-b98b-9c819725a77e" facs="#m-2dc96b85-47c0-472d-a723-e13350969663" label="ambiguous">Psalm 27.</l><l xml:id="m-be679dbb-d227-4dfa-90dd-0f1bcbd08d03" facs="#m-6f0e33f9-50e7-4a51-96ea-03cc8abdaf5e" label="lyrics-like">ritu éjus dolus.</l><l xml:id="m-7abcf260-e31a-49fa-87b8-54505fc2c6fc" facs="#m-e81c0f9c-123d-4b8b-be30-e3ced645445e" label="lyrics-like">Quóniam tácui, inveteravérunt</l><l xml:id="m-1f992160-64d9-4442-8953-0431b5fe3571" facs="#m-35cd83b7-925e-4699-b907-5343429d7115" label="lyrics-like">ID te, Dómine, clamábo, Déus</l><l xml:id="m-f60daaba-98ef-40c6-84e2-b158d0defff0" facs="#m-e45c665a-f158-4a6d-b552-ead3061b8d74" label="lyrics-like">óssa méa, * dum clamárem tóta</l><l xml:id="m-1c42c9bc-ffd6-4cbc-b611-0e98af28bfde" facs="#m-d2893d7f-a88c-4a32-889f-8ac3ff4b89c9" label="lyrics-like">H méus, ne sileas a me: t nequán¬</l><l xml:id="m-5bd038db-63d7-4a16-829f-d5889437cd3f" facs="#m-b6e5dcae-e656-4780-b88d-4860cd87bb67" label="ambiguous">die.</l><l xml:id="m-9490a27f-18a8-4ebb-870a-bfa4dd8f4fab" facs="#m-1c8b8c61-ea0b-4e8e-b95f-833dbbf92e9c" label="lyrics-like">do táceas a me* et assimilábor</l><l xml:id="m-50b163a8-01f8-4f8c-b5e0-eaebde94e0ae" facs="#m-2f2aead7-13b9-4a2e-b6e3-67096d637013" label="lyrics-like">Quóniam die ac nócte graváta</l><l xml:id="m-ac3a1d79-94c8-43f5-b3ed-725af491a0d3" facs="#m-a8f54072-9913-4253-aaf5-c0164654d7ab" label="lyrics-like">descendéntibus in lácum.</l><l xml:id="m-9f71007a-5f0d-4ff7-8fbf-f6582dcc2c1c" facs="#m-d66342c9-a938-4f47-963f-639b44a5f0d8" label="lyrics-like">est super me mánus túa :* convér¬</l><l xml:id="m-4e6c6c4b-365e-4410-b8c8-0865818d55dd" facs="#m-2f10a819-066a-4d31-8cf6-ea4b80320c16" label="lyrics-like">Exáudi, Dómine, vócem depreca¬</l><l xml:id="m-070ddd59-6f70-4f42-8186-9b94f9c5e268" facs="#m-52485c31-da5e-4aa0-b17a-3fd4e9e45dea" label="lyrics-like">tiónis méae dum óro ad te :* dum</l><l xml:id="m-30ae01d8-f25a-485a-96ce-eb5169652008" facs="#m-f4038502-2091-4c0a-8c42-9b01903eed08" label="lyrics-like">sus sum in aerúmna méa, dum con¬</l><l xml:id="m-e8348f57-820e-44a2-a1c5-c5b73afd4772" facs="#m-ac8f1ca7-f7e6-4930-8dd9-38124d7c0971" label="ambiguous">figitur spina.</l><l xml:id="m-01d381eb-0ee8-42f5-9f4e-d460a96b5c8f" facs="#m-033eaeb7-8041-44df-a8ac-7635d34f6fcd" label="lyrics-like">extóllo mánus méas ad témplum</l><l xml:id="m-c0c7f275-9cd7-44fd-9d31-0ccc6be61aad" facs="#m-43816a63-e4f6-482f-b439-6a7cbaacf27b" label="lyrics-like">Delictum méum cógnitum tibi</l><l xml:id="m-c3c6faba-0384-451a-99c2-ab591eb5312a" facs="#m-f6beac73-51d1-46d2-a288-69d6446e5f1c" label="lyrics-like">sánctum túum.</l><l xml:id="m-92904560-1c38-4135-8e2c-f3444d7fb8b9" facs="#m-7cdf8eb1-77ff-4a73-af8d-cc65899c6b4e" label="lyrics-like">féci:* et injustitiam méam non</l><l xml:id="m-d454bdf1-dea3-4054-ac7b-74ad929c5cba" facs="#m-111f3a1d-5df2-4327-8da6-b4080c95761e" label="lyrics-like">Ne simul tráhas me cum pecca¬</l><l xml:id="m-db12f57a-f901-4516-8b6a-8ddc91ed64d3" facs="#m-38217dd2-5c60-418c-a932-f73372bc5da6" label="lyrics-like">abscóndi.</l><l xml:id="m-ee7a0b42-ef45-4a59-81d8-f6a405fe3117" facs="#m-d1283ad2-2562-4127-b58c-158bcfc28dba" label="lyrics-like">tóribus :* et cum operántibus ini¬</l><l xml:id="m-4b60b829-d1a5-450c-9bf6-0ec3e9aa3c66" facs="#m-ee92cf06-9bcb-4d75-ac82-8125bf4a4276" label="lyrics-like">Dixi : Confitébor advérsum me</l><l xml:id="m-e0fb006c-946c-465a-98ed-e186870e2c9c" facs="#m-a7feb57b-a6a3-49df-85f4-8ea6c582169e" label="lyrics-like">quitátem ne perdas me:</l><l xml:id="m-c6d3b733-cfcc-4db8-89b8-6cd8fbd7b99a" facs="#m-37785467-b6fc-401f-a8e1-fbd0f2527bfc" label="lyrics-like">Qui loquúntur pácem cum pró¬</l><l xml:id="m-ea335b99-2bc0-49e2-9b6d-b7ae772a5153" facs="#m-2b369601-92ce-44fe-8c4e-61c061264f3f" label="lyrics-like">injustitiam méam Dómino :* et tu</l><l xml:id="m-4749d536-228a-4eff-96ec-2942c462eaf3" facs="#m-0b01c1ce-f9da-428e-9e1c-da4998c05776" label="lyrics-like">remisisti impietâtem peccati méi.</l><l xml:id="m-b4f235c8-9805-42fc-b0b4-53163cbae915" facs="#m-01f39c00-5991-403e-aeaa-39943a172f14" label="lyrics-like">ximo súo,*mála autem in córdi¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b4a02e8-220c-479a-aee2-621647914081" facs="#m-2d5ef7b7-75a9-424d-a2bd-41b658f36a02" label="lyrics-like">Pro hac orábit ad te ómnis sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-295603c4-3e31-48af-8fda-b056ac261501" facs="#m-1e04cb17-1638-4c22-9075-1cbe749c7e24" label="lyrics-like">bus eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-86ca63b0-689a-413b-8a98-3c566d7dd4bd" facs="#m-5d934297-cc78-4e90-8018-7a8102e37d7f" label="lyrics-like">ctus, * in témpore opportuno.</l><l xml:id="m-b2d31d62-6f14-4334-b8cf-552f378e64ea" facs="#m-360b373b-67b5-49ed-92db-a142b2460584" label="lyrics-like">Da illis secúndum ópera eórum."</l><l xml:id="m-fea603da-6f8a-4fd0-8cb2-aca4e95b0523" facs="#m-8c30a335-c2e7-424c-befa-20bc80ac7930" label="lyrics-like">Verúmtamen in di