c6" facs="#m-b40a32c2-8123-4675-ba35-5a906798e0e4" label="lyrics-like">Intelléctum tibi dábo, et instruam</l><l xml:id="m-9da383ba-5d81-401a-a594-7d76d07c1dbe" facs="#m-eaeb037c-46af-4378-a9c8-0ea8717b04b3" label="lyrics-like">éjus : * déstrues illos, et non aedi¬</l><l xml:id="m-d0161356-8bf2-43c6-8d5e-8681c0463323" facs="#m-b2051e4a-af40-428d-8e6a-ca0d447ae222" label="lyrics-like">te in via hac qua gradiéris :* fir¬</l><l xml:id="m-4ff2ef1a-9138-4053-9dff-2cc08484a26c" facs="#m-c615cd57-5731-4404-8e3b-2e867388b5a2" label="lyrics-like">ficábis éos.</l><l xml:id="m-86aa57a3-e57e-49de-8921-749235a34045" facs="#m-a208f138-2dba-4062-9b4c-116cafd32b18" label="lyrics-like">Benedictus Dóminus :* quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-59af2fb4-61f9-4853-94e5-0a194313cfbc" facs="#m-662fb513-4dab-4b34-808d-0da95d875555" label="lyrics-like">mábo super te óculos méos.</l><l xml:id="m-a52e6f6d-599f-4652-802a-f93e34292a4d" facs="#m-053ea7bd-63a4-4709-a8d5-b5d100d972a7" label="lyrics-like">Nolite fieri sicut équus et múlus,»</l><l xml:id="m-d99b0b5a-c8b9-4d33-ba05-1355ebaae845" facs="#m-daa62f56-ccdd-426d-aa45-9c3e21985765" label="lyrics-like">exaudívit vócem deprecatiónis</l><l xml:id="m-592d7b97-8a3b-4a4c-bea1-bd608554d7e9" facs="#m-445fb27f-9a3c-4b4d-a96b-d3f8ef672b1d" label="lyrics-like">quíbus non est intelléctus.</l><l xml:id="m-39c4648e-95d6-4416-a81e-f92a303b37f0" facs="#m-cf5e2d29-7658-4ef0-9a6b-c2bba77a9b0e" label="lyrics-like">méae.</l><l xml:id="m-ba20e0a5-6e99-4164-9667-9e4e6a32d76e" facs="#m-914f9342-7e89-46ab-a44e-460aa0d8caac" label="lyrics-like">In cámo et fréno maxillas eórum</l><l xml:id="m-e24be70c-64ec-4cc1-9eeb-45b92a58383f" facs="#m-01352803-04b0-413f-aacf-e9a42abe696f" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus adjútor méus et proté¬</l><l xml:id="m-ff218762-1400-49c0-bb2d-6c688fe5cf41" facs="#m-8f317a1f-3bdd-4fc5-9f47-b57a59d06f29" label="lyrics-like">constringe, * qui non appróximant</l><l xml:id="m-3bca1abc-522c-4449-989c-e48e1000e8ac" facs="#m-b1bf4c67-4381-4e54-9727-b5442b960c4e" label="lyrics-like">ctor méus: *in ipso sperávit cor</l><l xml:id="m-e35ac339-5629-4ab6-bca7-d42c6fe81420" facs="#m-861df33e-f641-44fe-82e3-aabdf616a0fa" label="ambiguous">ad te.</l><l xml:id="m-f63425b3-2912-47f0-8d8c-75982f53876c" facs="#m-6e30f185-e4d2-4f02-8d48-c8371c46e583" label="lyrics-like">méum, et aajútus sum.</l><l xml:id="m-a4dbe89a-b4ce-44b7-adf6-fc77d35bd67b" facs="#m-357ce7d7-3e77-4891-93da-3fd97d8f5142" label="lyrics-like">Múlta flagélla peccatóris, * spe¬</l><l xml:id="m-8dc72e10-61c9-4164-b987-66080f2ae35c" facs="#m-9aa869c8-e96b-4f38-b373-f94447591e72" label="lyrics-like">Et reflóruit cáro méa: * et ex</l><l xml:id="m-77af7f3d-bfe3-4f01-b7d2-2e96ce517931" facs="#m-6fd91111-2581-4649-9da2-5aaa013a186e" label="lyrics-like">rántem autem in Dómino miseri¬</l><l xml:id="m-d1260f80-3c8f-468e-aefc-d68ee2c1a945" facs="#m-b19b5ca0-52aa-42a9-a757-ed899e666fed" label="lyrics-like">voluntáte méa confitébor éi.</l><l xml:id="m-59c47f21-2f44-42fa-ac5c-44db5392a29c" facs="#m-685560e2-d952-4199-853a-c5982135b626" label="lyrics-like">córdia cireumdabit.</l><l xml:id="m-662741d2-f961-4e0b-87b7-9b67af991446" facs="#m-a99f24cf-4f85-4292-8f9f-ac7bd52e395c" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus fortitúdo plébis súae:*</l><l xml:id="m-88a797b2-0eb4-4e6b-819c-63b6ff7f9ddb" facs="#m-c3f3ede1-a853-4daf-ac93-fba42b450311" label="lyrics-like">Lactámini in Dómino, et exsul¬</l><l xml:id="m-ce5c13a5-b23d-4427-ae44-a627f3904845" facs="#m-b6cd727b-4d94-4816-9b5f-c29a12536df8" label="lyrics-like">et protéctor salvatiónum Christi</l><l xml:id="m-73a4cb06-2519-47a0-95db-b32fbb18113b" facs="#m-96df7d17-08c5-4a54-9bd3-2db5e1a9093c" label="lyrics-like">táte, jústi :* et gloriámini, ómnes</l><l xml:id="m-4043587f-5894-4b7b-bfdb-27025a693c51" facs="#m-16fb66a7-50c5-4b3b-b5f2-4592b0cfe7b3" label="ambiguous">sui est.</l><l xml:id="m-6e438859-ba49-43c7-b711-8c0b488d2858" facs="#m-a6f4e54f-ed88-4479-913b-a6c8cea9f143" label="lyrics-like">récti corde.</l><l xml:id="m-c34bd1f2-01f2-4720-b624-3f9674e562ce" facs="#m-b5e8b1a9-82ff-4743-b434-f644709942f5" label="lyrics-like">Sálvum fac pópulum túum, Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-e358c35f-0058-417f-8f0f-d929e13dd012" facs="#m-5a999c0e-8de0-4289-9591-5afcab33314b" label="lyrics-like">Réquiem aetérnam * dóna éis,</l><l xml:id="m-d0163f12-40fd-4dd1-8305-832785521359" facs="#m-5a85961b-b1f7-4aec-bad7-1185b56ddeab" label="lyrics-like">mine, et bénedic haereditáti túae:"</l><l xml:id="m-c96565a0-7a62-4d6e-bbf7-f259d43256ee" facs="#m-5adf2fb4-17e1-4e61-a8bc-85ea8df4ae79" label="lyrics-like">Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-7adb18de-91b6-428d-8586-eac29d4c42e7" facs="#m-723da12f-2e9c-44cc-b7e7-5f85ec8265ab" label="lyrics-like">et rége éos, et extólle illos usque</l><l xml:id="m-78471e8a-9cab-4b5c-bfd3-1b426443d557" facs="#m-9f8b40cf-1918-403f-b474-3d4bd2974db2" label="lyrics-like">Et lux perpétua * lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-a8e575b5-7b48-40d4-b139-3588929b10ad" facs="#m-ac441704-66fd-4c69-aea4-925b219e6948" label="lyrics-like">in aetérnum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
